OL,3,GNEWSAWomen walk in solidarity after
OL,4,Arape on trail
OL,5,
OL,6,FA community walk has been organised in
OL,7,FBarnsley to show solidarity with women
OL,8,Fwho are victims of violence.
OL,10,FThe Women's Safety Walk was set up
OL,11,Fafter a woman reported that she was
OL,12,Fraped on the Trans Pennine Trail near
OL,13,FBolton-upon-Dearne on 4 November.
OL,15,FSisters Lisa and Laura Bedford
OL,16,Forganised the event, and said it sends
OL,17,Fa message "that women are standing
OL,18,Ftogether, and that men are standing
OL,19,Fwith them."
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
